{
    "title": "Ball Brawl 3D - Soccer Cup",
    "description": "Ball Brawl - fun filled soccer game!\r\nStep onto the field with your own unique team and show off your skills to beat the other teams!\r\nAn intense experience based on speed, reflexes and strategy awaits you in Ball Brawl. Watch out for the head balls! Crown your score with super goals.\r\n\r\nIn Ball Brawl, your goal is to throw the ball into the opposite goal without giving the ball to the opponents, there are no rules. You can do things even kids can do with your crazy and super kicks.\r\n\r\nUse simple and intuitive controls to control your own ball, move fast, dodge your attacks and use your skills to achieve victory!\r\n\r\nYou can choose your favorite among many unique teams with different skills and characteristics and customize your character.\r\nBall Brawl is packed with exciting multiplayer modes!\r\n\r\nYou can compete in real time with your friends or other players around the world.\r\n\r\nJoin online leagues, challenge players striving to climb the leaderboards and make your name known worldwide!\r\n\r\nYou can also constantly refresh your gaming experience by unlocking new arenas and challenges as you progress.\r\n\r\nThanks to its stunning graphics and impressive sound effects, Ball Brawl will provide you with an extraordinary visual experience.\r\n\r\nWith its fluid game mechanics and competitive atmosphere, you will have an addictive experience.\r\n\r\nJoin Ball Brawl now and show off your skills to excel in real-time ruleless soccer!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ball Brawl - fun filled soccer game!<br>Step onto the field with your own unique team and show off your skills to beat the other teams!<br>An intense experience based on speed, reflexes and strategy awaits you in Ball Brawl. Watch out for the head balls! Crown your score with super goals.<br><br>In Ball Brawl, your goal is to throw the ball into the opposite goal without giving the ball to the opponents, there are no rules. You can do things even kids can do with your crazy and super kicks.<br><br>Use simple and intuitive controls to control your own ball, move fast, dodge your attacks and use your skills to achieve victory!<br><br>You can choose your favorite among many unique teams with different skills and characteristics and customize your character.<br>Ball Brawl is packed with exciting multiplayer modes!<br><br>You can compete in real time with your friends or other players around the world.<br><br>Join online leagues, challenge players striving to climb the leaderboards and make your name known worldwide!<br><br>You can also constantly refresh your gaming experience by unlocking new arenas and challenges as you progress.<br><br>Thanks to its stunning graphics and impressive sound effects, Ball Brawl will provide you with an extraordinary visual experience.<br><br>With its fluid game mechanics and competitive atmosphere, you will have an addictive experience.<br><br>Join Ball Brawl now and show off your skills to excel in real-time ruleless soccer!",
